OL,3,GNEWSABoulders dropped off coast to
OL,4,Adisrupt deep fishing
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreenpeace claimed it had "effectively
OL,7,Fclosed 116 sq km (45 sq miles) of the
OL,8,FSouthern North Sea Marine Protected
OL,9,FArea (MPA) to bottom trawling". The
OL,10,FDepartment for Environment, Food and
OL,11,FRural Affairs (Defra) said "activities
OL,12,Fat sea should be carried out lawfully".
